{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29133","headline":"陪宣城大夫崔公泛後池兼北楼讌二首 一 · 许浑","name":"陪宣城大夫崔公泛後池兼北楼讌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陪泛芳池醉北楼，水花繁艳照膺舟。\n亭台阴合树初昼，弦管韵高山欲秋。\n皆贺虢岩终选傅，自伤燕谷未逢邹。\n昔时恩遇今能否，一尉沧洲已白头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}